  "notes": "ドイツ (Germany, from the German word 'Deutsch') + the suffix {語|ご} (language). Like other language names, it combines a country or people name with {語|ご}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ドイツ{語|ご}を{習|なら}う: to learn German\n- ドイツ{語|ご}{圏|けん}: the German-speaking world\n- ドイツ{語|ご}が{得意|とくい}だ: to be good at German\n\nRELATED LANGUAGE NAMES:\n- {英語|えいご}: English\n- フランス{語|ご}: French\n- {中国語|ちゅうごくご}: Chinese",
